HELP.md
target/
# Generated at build time by api/Dockerfile (AGPLv3 source bundle)
src/main/resources/static/source/
# Generated React SPA (built by `mvn package` at repo root or scripts/build-frontend.*).
# The committed api assets here are api-docs.html, css/ and images/ - keep those.
src/main/resources/static/static/
src/main/resources/static/index.html
src/main/resources/static/asset-manifest.json
